  "instructions": [
    "Fill a large pot with 2 cups of water and bring to a boil.",
    "Add the chicken broth, sliced mushrooms, chopped onion, and grated carrots to the pot.",
    "Reduce heat to medium-low and simmer for 10 minutes.",
    "Add the rice noodles to the pot and steam for 5 minutes.",
    "Stir in the turmeric and black pepper.",
    "Serve the noodles in a tagliere vessel.",
